nullfetch (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add terminal images: built-in PNG renderer plus chafa, viu, jp2,
    img2txt, timg, Kitty and iTerm2 protocols.
  * Add 20 new modules, --all, --list-fields and CSV/Markdown output.
  * Collect modules in parallel and cache slow values.
  * Extend configuration with modules, separators, bars and image options.

 -- pybindi <sungunboom@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

